ystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全面升级Codex编程工具，新增后台运行、内置浏览器及按需付费模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 签署 200 亿美元协议采购 Cerebras 芯片并获得认股权证入股</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Opus 4.7模型，强化编程与逻辑推理能力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌开源医疗AI模型MedGemma 1.5，支持3D影像分析与病历处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a6315d9ca34cd01d8d64b38d0f4ce411.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式开源医疗AI模型MedGemma 1.5，该模型在保持4B参数量不变的前提下，实现了对高维度医疗数据的深度处理能力。MedGemma 1.5原生支持CT与MRI三维扫描数据分析，可处理包含数十个切片的立体影像，并具备全视野病理切片分析、胸部X光精准标注及多时间点病情对比能力。此外，模型对PDF格式电子病历和化验单的结构化数据提取能力显著增强。性能方面，相比MedGemma 14B，新版本在3D MRI分类准确率提升11%，全视野病理图像宏观F1分数提升47%，胸部X光解剖定位交并比增加35%。技术上，团队采用了将3D CT切分为最多85张序列图像的预处理方法，并引入领域专家模型进行知识蒸馏。谷歌明确该模型定位为供开发者微调的基础资源，非直接临床决策工具，旨在通过开源推动医疗AI在多模态数据处理领域的进一</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">iOS 27 Beta代码曝光四项Apple Intelligence新功能，强化视觉智能与交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9554920f813b8c3e52ead50a3350ff56.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">iOS 27 Beta版后端代码显示，苹果计划引入四项Apple Intelligence新功能，旨在深化视觉智能应用并优化系统交互。视觉智能新增营养标签解析，可自动扫描食品包装数据并同步至“健康”应用；纸面信息识别功能升级，支持从印刷品提取电话号码或地址并一键存入通讯录。此外，苹果钱包将支持实体卡券数字化扫描，Safari浏览器则引入基于AI的智能标签组自动命名功能。这些更新暗示苹果正为未来的智能眼镜及带摄像头AirPods等可穿戴设备铺路。苹果预计将于6月WWDC 2026发布iOS 27，并于9月随新一代iPhone正式上线。此次升级通过跨应用Siri整合，进一步提升了Apple Intelligence在日常场景中的实用性与自动化水平。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全面升级Codex编程工具，新增后台运行、内置浏览器及按需付费模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a1cfdae6d4366f3cf8a7ceef2fced4d9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日宣布全面升级自动化编程工具Codex，旨在提升工具的实用性与灵活性，以应对来自Anthropic Claude Code的竞争。本次更新核心功能包括：支持后台运行，允许多个智能代理在Mac设备上并行处理任务而不干扰用户操作；新增内置浏览器功能，支持在网页应用中执行指令，未来将扩展至全面操控浏览器；引入“记忆”功能以记录工作会话上下文，并增加图像生成能力以辅助设计原型。此外，Codex接入了111款插件，可处理文书工作及生成待办清单。针对商业化落地，OpenAI为ChatGPT企业版与商业版用户推出了Codex按需付费定价方案。此次升级标志着OpenAI重心向企业级编程场景转移，通过增强多任务处理能力与工作流集成，进一步巩固其在AI编程助手领域的市场竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 签署 200 亿美元协议采购 Cerebras 芯片并获得认股权证入股</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bcc90ae280ae1fccd3afc68edf3fc9b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 与 AI 芯片初创公司 Cerebras 达成长期合作协议，承诺在未来三年内支付超 200 亿美元使用其芯片驱动的服务器集群，并获得 Cerebras 少数股权认股权证。此外，OpenAI 将注资约 10 亿美元专项用于建设高性能数据中心。Cerebras 核心的晶圆级引擎（WSE）技术具备极高的显存访问速度，旨在优化 OpenAI 下一代推理模型（如 Opus 4.7）的响应延迟。此举标志着 OpenAI 算力战略的重大调整，通过引入 Cerebras、AMD 及自研芯片构建混合架构，旨在降低对 NVIDIA 的依赖并破解算力垄断。尽管新兴架构的稳定性仍需验证，但该深度绑定协议将显著影响 AI 基础设施及底层算力市场格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Opus 4.7模型，强化编程与逻辑推理能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Opus 4.7模型，该版本重点提升了模型在复杂任务中的可靠性与逻辑严谨性。在SWE-bench Pro编程基准测试中，Opus 4.7得分达64.3%，超越GPT-5.4与Gemini 3.1 Pro；视觉推理基准CharXiv提升至82.1%，支持2576像素长边识别。该模型在工具调用与数据处理上表现出更强的韧性，遇到缺失信息时倾向于报错而非幻觉生成，并具备系统级代码编写前的数学证明能力。受全新分词器影响，Token消耗量较前代增加1至1.35倍。为应对成本变化，Anthropic新增xhigh思考强度档位，并推出深度审查指令/ultrareview、Auto Mode扩展及任务预算管控功能。尽管搜索评测表现略有回落，但其在工程协作中的准确性显著提升。此外，更强的Cl</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
